# Architecture

- Create the Fastify instance in `buildApp`; keep listening in `server.ts`.
- Keep route handlers thin; put business logic in services.
- Keep Prisma access in repositories or persistence modules.
- Manage schema only through `prisma/schema.prisma` and migrations.
- Do not add a second HTTP framework or ORM.
